    "text": "In natale sancti Ceadde episcopi & confessoris..\nMen \u00fea leofestan, ic eow onginnu secgan be \u00feam life \u00fees halgan weres sancte Ceaddan \u00fees biscopes, hu\n\u00deeah we nenge \u00feinga magen becuman to eallum \u00feam megenum his weorca for\u00feon \u00fee in him swa swi\u00f0e\nAh \u00feonne hwe\u00f0ere we eow recca\u00f0 medmicle intingan of miclum megenum to\u00feon \u00feet us genihtsumien \u00fea\nSe halga wer Ceadda erest wes gehadad in biscopdome fram Alwine se wes biscop in \u00feere lundoniscan\nNor\u00f0hymbra \u00feeoda rixiendum Oswie \u00feam kyninge in \u00feam selde \u00fee his eftergengan hefdon in \u00feam\n\u00d0a com \u00feeodorus se ercebiscop on breotone ealond.\nHe wes onsended fram \u00feam apostolican selde & mid \u00fey he manegu ealond geondferde & ealle \u00feing\nHe in gelumpenlicum stowum biscopas halgede & \u00fea \u00fee he unmedume gemette \u00fees godes geleafan he\nHe eac Ceaddan \u00feone biscop erest swi\u00f0e \u00fereade & segde \u00feet he unrihtlice gehalgod were.\nHe him Ceadda andswearede \u00feere eadmodestan stefne & cwe\u00f0, gif \u00feu me on wite \u00feet ic unrihtlice \u00feone\nAc ic for hersumnesse intingan geneded \u00feone had underfeng.\n& mid \u00fee swa he geherde \u00fea eadmodnisse his andsware \u00fea cwe\u00f0 he \u00feet he nenge \u00feinga \u00feone\nWilfrid eac swilce of breotan ealonde wes onsend & he on galwalum wes gehadod & for\u00f0on he beforan\n& \u00fea he com to hrofeceastre \u00fea wes Damianus se biscop for\u00f0fered & he \u00feer gehadode godne wer se\nSe ealles tylgest romanisce \u00feeawe song in godes circan \u00feone song he geleornade \u00e6t \u00feam iungrum \u00fees\n& eft hit gelomp on \u00fea tid \u00fee Wulfhere wes cining fore m\u00e6rcna meg\u00f0um & Germanna his biscop wes\nHe him nalde neowne biscop hadian ac he bed \u00e6t Oswio \u00feam cininge \u00feet him were sald Ceadda se\n& Wilfer\u00f0 wes \u00feere cirican biscop in eoferwicceastre & nohte \u00feon les ealra nor\u00f0hymbra ah eac swilce\n& \u00fea wes \u00feeaw \u00feam ilcan arwyr\u00feestan biscope Ceaddan \u00feet he godspell geond stowe bodade ma\nHine se ercebiscop mid his agene hond on horse ahof for\u00f0on \u00fee he hine swi\u00f0e haligne wer gemette &\n& \u00fea onfeng Ceadda m\u00e6rcna \u00feeode biscopdom samod on lindesfarena efter \u00feere bisne ealdra federa &\n\u00deam biscope Wulfhere se cining gesealde landes fiftig hida in \u00feere stowe seo is gecweden \u00e6t bearwe &\nHe hefde eft biscopseld in \u00feere stowe seo is gecweden licetfeld in \u00feere he for\u00f0ferde & bebyriged wes\nHe warhte eac degulran eardungstowe in \u00feere he synderlicor mid feawum \u00feet wes mid seofenum o\u00f0\u00f0e\nHe eac in \u00feere ilcan meg\u00f0e on twam gearum & on halfum gere \u00fea wuldelicestan cirican arerde \u00fea wes\n\u00deet wes gecweden be \u00feam cwalme his lichaman \u00feet he sceolde his \u00feone halgan gast sendan of \u00feisum\nMittes per monige bro\u00f0ore of \u00feere gesomnunge \u00fees arwur\u00f0estan biscopes of lichama atogene weron \u00fea\n\u00d0a gelomp hit sume dege \u00feet he Ceadda wunade in \u00feere foresegdan eardungstowe mid anum bre\u00feer \u00fees\nSe ilca Owine wes munuc micelre geearnunge & clenre ingehygde & he abad \u00feet uplice edlean & he\nHe com mid E\u00feel\u00f0ryden cwene of eastengla m\u00e6g\u00f0\u00e6 & he wes \u00e6ldost hire \u00feegna & ealdormon hire\nNe dyde he \u00feet naht slaulice ac he hine eallum middangeardas ehtum ongerede & forletenum eallum\nHe hine gegerede mid anfalde gegerelan & ber acse & eadusan him on honda & com to \u00feam mynstre\n\u00deet wes geciged l\u00e6stinga \u00e6g ne com he to idelnesse to \u00feam mynstre swa sume men do\u00fe ac he tacnade\nCu\u00f0lice se ilca Owine mid \u00feone biscop in \u00feere forsegdan eardungstowe betwih o\u00f0rum bro\u00f0rum wes\nSe mid \u00fey \u00feyslices hwethugu sume dege \u00feerute warhte & se biscop wes ana in his gebedhuses stowe\n\u00dea stefne he erest geherde easten & su\u00fean \u00feet wes fram \u00fees heofones heanisse & sy\u00f0\u00f0an sticcemelum\n& he \u00fea ymbhydelice his mod f\u00e6stnade in \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee he \u00feer geherde & \u00fea geherde he feringa swaswa\n& mitte hit \u00fea wunade on \u00feere stowe swaswa tide fec swilce hit \u00feunurrad were & he \u00fea ymbhygdie\n\u00d0a ontynde se biscop Ceadda \u00feet eg\u00f0yrl \u00fees gebedhuses & hof his honda upp swaswa he foroft\n& \u00fea eode he ricene in to him & \u00fea cwe\u00f0 se biscop to him, fer \u00feu ricene to cirican & gedo \u00feu \u00feet heo\nMittes heo \u00fea swa comon \u00fea manode he Ceadda heo erest \u00feet hi lufan & megen & sibbe him\nSy\u00f0\u00f0an he him \u00fea under\u00feeodde & cy\u00f0de \u00feone deg his for\u00f0fore \u00fee \u00fea iu him neh stod.\nHe cwe\u00f0, se leofwynda cuma se gewunade \u00feet he \u00fea ure bro\u00f0ra neosade he nu todeg wes geeadmodad\nCerra\u00f0 ge for\u00feon to cirican & secga\u00f0 urum bro\u00f0rum \u00feet heo minne endedeg drihtne mid benum\n& mittes he \u00feas sprec & manegu \u00feisum gelic hi \u00fea onfengon his bletsunge \u00fea hi swi\u00f0e unrote ut\n\u00dea cwe\u00f0 he Cedda, fregn \u00fees \u00fee \u00feu wille.\n\u00dea cwe\u00f0 he to \u00feam biscope, Ic \u00fee halsie \u00feet \u00feu me secge hwet wes se blissendra song \u00fee ic geherde of\n\u00d0a answarude se biscop Ceadda him & cwe\u00f0, Gif \u00feu songes stefne geherdest & heofonlicne \u00fereat\nCu\u00f0lice ic \u00fee secge \u00feet hit weron engla gastas \u00fea comon me gecigan to \u00feam heofonlican rice \u00fea ic a\n\u00deet eallswa hit mid wordum gecweden wes swa hit wes mid weorcum gefylled.\n& he \u00fea ricene mid lichaman ece wes gehrinen & \u00fea \u00fey seofo\u00f0an dege swaswa him gehaten wes efter\nNes \u00feet naht wunderlic \u00feet he \u00feone dea\u00fees deg swa unforht abad for\u00feon \u00fee hit nes dea\u00f0es deg ac his\n& ealles swi\u00feest he wes in eallum his weorcum godes lufan gemyndig & his \u00feera nehstena.\nSwa hit sum bro\u00f0or segde \u00feone he in gewritum lerde & he wes in his mynstere & in his laredome\nHe segde, gif \u00feet gelumpe \u00feet se biscop Ceadda his bec redde o\u00f0\u00f0e hwet swilces dyde gif \u00fees windes\nGif \u00feonne strengra se wind astod he \u00feonne betynedre \u00feere bec, for\u00f0leat in his anseone & geornlicor\n& gif \u00feonne git se storm wes strengra o\u00f0\u00f0e yste \u00feeosne middangeard bregdon & \u00feunurrade & l\u00e6getas\n& mittes hine fregnaden his gingran forhwon he \u00feet dyde \u00f0a andwyrde he him & cwe\u00f0, Ac ne\nDrihten onstyre\u00f0 lyftas & awecce\u00f0 windas.\nHe sceota\u00f0 legeto & he leo\u00f0ra\u00f0 of heofone \u00feet he \u00fea eor\u00f0lican mod awecce hine to ondredenne & \u00feet\nFor\u00f0on us gedafena\u00f0, cwe\u00f0 se biscop Ceadda, \u00feet we his monunge \u00feere heofonlican andswarien mid\nBidden we sona ymbhygdilice his mildheortnisse \u00feet we toslegenum ure heortena digolnessum &\nHit gelomp be \u00feere for\u00f0fore \u00fees foresegdan biscopes \u00feet com to hys gemynde onwrignesse \u00feet word\n& hi \u00feoncfulle weron in gebecum & in forhefednisse & in leornunge godcundra gewrita.\nAc efter\u00feon \u00fee he wes gecerred on his \u00e6\u00feel se o\u00f0er el\u00feeodig for drihtnes lufan \u00feurhwunade o\u00f0 his\nMittes him to com of breotene ealonde \u00e6fter longe tide mid neosunge gefe se halgesta wer & se\n& hio gefegun heora somnunge.\nHeo comon to \u00feere gemynd\u00e6 \u00fees arwur\u00f0estan biscopes Ceaddan.\n\u00d0a cwe\u00f0 sanctus \u00e6gberht, Ic wat enne man in \u00feisum ealonde mittes se halga wer Ceadda se biscop\n\u00d0onne hwe\u00f0ere us \u00feet wuna\u00f0 uncu\u00f0 hwe\u00f0er he hit be him seolfum segde hwe\u00f0er \u00fee be o\u00f0rum men\nSancte Ceadde for\u00f0ferda in \u00feam dege sexta nonas martis.\n& he wes erest bebyrged be sancta Marian cirican ac efter\u00feon \u00feer mon getimbrade cirican &\nIn gehwe\u00f0re \u00feera stowa gelomlico helo & wundra beo\u00f0 gewrohte to cu\u00f0nesse his megena.\nHit gelomp \u00feet sum woda se eall \u00feet lond dwoligende geondearn \u00feet he on efenne \u00feider becom swa \u00fea\n& he cudde eallum \u00feam mannum wundrigendum hwet him \u00feer drihten to helo forgifen hefde.\nSeo stow \u00feere byrgene wes treowene \u00feruh & heo wes gewarht ufan on huses gelicnesse.\n& \u00feer stonde\u00fe wigbed be \u00feere \u00feruh \u00feet hafe\u00f0 \u00feyrel on \u00feam wage \u00feurh \u00feet gewunia\u00f0 \u00fea men \u00fee \u00fea\n& mittes hit mon in weter senda\u00f0 & sele\u00f0 untruman horsum o\u00f0\u00f0e nutenum o\u00f0\u00f0e mannum to byrgenne\nIn \u00feere stowe \u00feeodorus gehadode Wynfer\u00f0, godne wer & gemetfestne swa his forgengan mercna\nSe Wynfer\u00f0 wes of preosthade \u00fees biscopes \u00fee he \u00e6fterfylgede & he diacones \u00feegnunge under him\nGenihtsumien us nu, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feas \u00fee us segd earun be \u00feam arwur\u00f0an biscope sancte Ceaddan\nEale, \u00feet wes eadig w\u00e6r in \u00feam ne wes enig inwit ne he nenigne fordemde ne he nenigne gehende ne\n& mittes he wes heh biscop on orleahtre & swilce \u00feeah \u00fee he fram untrumum & unwisum preostum\nAc he a an & \u00feet ilce sume gemete heofonlice blisse ber on his onseone.\nNes nefre in his mu\u00f0e nymp\u00f0e crist nymp\u00f0e mildheortnis.\nBidden we nu men \u00fea untodeledlican \u00ferinnesse \u00feet we mid \u00feam benum \u00fees halgestan weres sancte",
